{
  "schema": "fcb.design-plan/1",
  "spec_id": "g3-dev-011-lever-arm",
  "spec_text": "A lever arm from 8 mm plate, 90 mm long and 20 mm wide. A 12 mm pivot bore sits on the centreline 15 mm from one end, and an 8 mm linkage hole sits on the centreline 15 mm from the other end. Both holes go through.",
